			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-442070">
									

<p>Complexity is a necesitty. SCP foundation is not Magic the Gathering, we're not here to "play cards". This is necessary to simulate the complexity of the task. Theplayers must feel that they are "securing, containing and protecting" SCPs before fighting an opposent (with cards).<br />
